        <mxCell id="mEPmVh9MIZ-benf4uP2a-3" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Feature&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;1、Store the user data in the ms sqlserver database&lt;br&gt;2、administrator can distribute user&#39;s data to the turnstile&lt;br&gt;3、Accept notification from the facial machine/turnstile aynchronously&lt;br&gt;4、send sim message user the sim card (not by network)&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
