        <mxCell id="mEPmVh9MIZ-benf4uP2a-16" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Sim mesage device&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;1) the user should by a sim card from telcom(Globe, Smart etc), and register/load the card&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;2) plugin the card into the device&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;3) the device will send sim message according to instruction from PC Server&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;aynchronously after the server get the notification of the turnstile&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
