        <mxCell id="mEPmVh9MIZ-benf4uP2a-40" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Facial Recognition Machine/Tripod Turnstile&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;1、the facial recognition machine will store the user&#39;s data in its own storage&amp;nbsp; after the pc server distribute the user&#39;s information&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;2、the facial recogniton macine can capture the user&#39;s real time picture and compare to the images stored in its storage&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;3、after the comparison verification passed, the facial recogniton will open the tripod gate&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;4、after the user pass the gate, the turnstile will send a notification to the pc server&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;aynchronously&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;5、the facial recogniton machine like a mini computer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="10" y="700" width="550" height="220" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
